After an incorrect ARC output, reject the full proposed transformation, not only its parameter (for example, a fill's color). First record exactly which cells the attempt changed and which regions it preserved. Then re-read the demo input/output differences and compare their full changed-cell sets to the attempted operation. A demo may contain independent effects in several distant objects; implementing only the visually obvious local effect is not a validated rule.

